    "title": "Topgolf",
    "description": "The Topgolf App is the best way to play!\r\n \r\nWith our app, you can:\r\n\r\n-Get live estimated wait times\r\n-Join our waitlist from wherever you are\r\n-Reserve bays and play when you want\r\n-Turn up your experience with exclusive in-venue features\r\n-Explore our latest offers\r\n-Load money for game play\r\n-Track your game history and stats\r\n-Stay up to date on our latest events, news, and offers\r\n\r\nIn-Venue mode puts more control in your hands\u2014sign everyone in, check out the menu, review your stats, control your bay\u2019s TV, and even capture memories with our social filters.\r\n \r\nTopgolf believes in the unlimited power of play\u2014we invite you to take a few swings, have some fun, and most importantly come play around!\r\n \r\nNot all features are available at every venue\u2014but the fun is!",
